1
00:00:00,569 --> 00:00:03,569
(footsteps approaching)

2
00:00:07,112 --> 00:00:10,612
(wood crashes)

3
00:00:11,779 --> 00:00:13,171
That was a close
one! Are you all right?

4
00:00:13,195 --> 00:00:14,196
Salmon.

5
00:00:15,113 --> 00:00:16,154
Here it comes!

6
00:00:17,947 --> 00:00:18,863
Stop it!

7
00:00:18,947 --> 00:00:20,030
(bells ringing)

8
00:00:20,113 --> 00:00:23,030
Convergence! Piercing Blood!

9
00:00:26,406 --> 00:00:27,239
[Megumi] Did he wound it?

10
00:00:27,322 --> 00:00:30,155
So he was holding back
when he fought me?

11
00:00:31,239 --> 00:00:33,156
[Noritoshi] Hurry! Those
wounds'll heal quickly!

12
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:35,657
(footsteps departing)

13
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:37,156
(Inumaki gasps)

14
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:39,282
[Noritoshi]
Inumaki will stop it.

15
00:00:39,365 --> 00:00:41,907
We'll attack, and then
we'll get away from it.

16
00:00:41,991 --> 00:00:44,283
Then we'll repeat that as
we try to get outside this veil,

17
00:00:44,366 --> 00:00:45,950
and rejoin the
principal and the others.

18
00:00:46,033 --> 00:00:47,700
(wall crashes in)

19
00:00:47,783 --> 00:00:49,050
[Noritoshi] But
there's no telling

20
00:00:49,074 --> 00:00:51,157
when this current
balance will fall apart!

21
00:00:51,241 --> 00:00:53,742
(dark music)

22
00:00:53,826 --> 00:00:54,993
[Noritoshi] His cursed speech

23
00:00:55,075 --> 00:00:56,395
doesn't seem to
be very effective,

24
00:00:56,450 --> 00:00:59,701
and we're not getting a
chance to contact the teachers.

25
00:00:59,784 --> 00:01:02,285
If it figures out how to
deal with his cursed speech,

26
00:01:02,368 --> 00:01:03,702
we're finished.

27
00:01:03,785 --> 00:01:05,702
(wood crashes)

28
00:01:05,785 --> 00:01:06,702
(footsteps approaching)

29
00:01:06,785 --> 00:01:07,827
Hurry!

30
00:01:08,618 --> 00:01:09,243
(Megumi grunts)

31
00:01:09,326 --> 00:01:11,285
[Noritoshi] We still don't know

32
00:01:11,368 --> 00:01:12,387
what this cursed spirit's after!

33
00:01:12,411 --> 00:01:14,171
It's possible the
principal and the sorcerers

34
00:01:14,244 --> 00:01:17,995
stationed at Jujutsu Tech
haven't taken any action yet.

35
00:01:19,244 --> 00:01:20,387
I'd like to join up with Todo.

36
00:01:20,411 --> 00:01:23,620
Or at the very least, Miwa, but-

37
00:01:25,037 --> 00:01:26,120
(door opens)

38
00:01:26,203 --> 00:01:29,704
(intense music)

39
00:01:30,829 --> 00:01:33,246
(wood crashes)

40
00:01:34,830 --> 00:01:35,746
(Nue caws)

41
00:01:35,830 --> 00:01:38,871
Inumaki will stop it
for you! Attack it now!

42
00:01:40,288 --> 00:01:41,539
Stop!

43
00:01:41,622 --> 00:01:44,372
-(blood splatters)
-(Noritoshi gasps)

44
00:01:44,455 --> 00:01:47,622
(Inumaki gags)

45
00:01:49,289 --> 00:01:51,210
[Noritoshi] He's the
one hitting his limit first?

46
00:01:51,290 --> 00:01:53,123
(Noritoshi gasps)

47
00:01:53,206 --> 00:01:56,123
(Noritoshi yells)

48
00:01:56,206 --> 00:01:59,081
(Megumi grunts)

49
00:02:00,833 --> 00:02:03,124
How're you doing,
Kamo? Still alive?

50
00:02:03,207 --> 00:02:05,749
(dark music)

51
00:02:07,541 --> 00:02:09,625
[Megumi] Inumaki wasn't
even using powerful words,

52
00:02:09,709 --> 00:02:12,083
but it still
destroyed his throat!

53
00:02:12,166 --> 00:02:13,959
This thing's just
that much stronger!

54
00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:18,750
(dark music)

55
00:02:19,876 --> 00:02:22,960
(Megumi gasps)

56
00:02:23,043 --> 00:02:24,084
Mustard leaf.

57
00:02:26,668 --> 00:02:28,334
Don't, Inumaki!

58
00:02:28,418 --> 00:02:30,460
It's way too strong!

59
00:02:30,544 --> 00:02:33,961
(footsteps approaching)

60
00:02:40,712 --> 00:02:42,086
Blast away!

61
00:02:42,169 --> 00:02:44,712
(wood crashes)

62
00:02:46,169 --> 00:02:48,337
(Inumaki gags)

63
00:02:57,212 --> 00:02:59,505
(dark music)

64
00:03:00,547 --> 00:03:02,356
[Hanami] You can't hope to
cut me with that dull blade.

65
00:03:02,380 --> 00:03:05,755
(Maki grunts)

66
00:03:09,089 --> 00:03:10,007
(Megumi grunts)

67
00:03:10,089 --> 00:03:11,131
(wood snaps)

68
00:03:12,715 --> 00:03:15,172
(dark music)

69
00:03:16,298 --> 00:03:18,132
[Megumi] Its eye
trees are more fragile

70
00:03:18,215 --> 00:03:19,257
than the rest of it!

71
00:03:20,382 --> 00:03:21,525
[Hanami] Now, that
sword isn't so bad.

72
00:03:21,549 --> 00:03:24,799
(fast music)

73
00:03:27,466 --> 00:03:29,258
I have something even better.

74
00:03:30,591 --> 00:03:34,925
Though I have to say, using
this one feels disgusting.

75
00:03:35,009 --> 00:03:37,926
(rock music)

76
00:03:38,010 --> 00:03:40,384
[Kiyotaka] "Cursed tools" are
weapons imbued with curses.

77
00:03:43,175 --> 00:03:44,318
Based on their force
and their effects,

78
00:03:44,342 --> 00:03:47,885
they're divided into
grades one through four,

79
00:03:47,969 --> 00:03:49,927
just like sorcerers.

80
00:03:50,011 --> 00:03:52,052
The higher a
cursed tool's grade,

81
00:03:52,135 --> 00:03:54,260
the greater the advantage
it provides its user

82
00:03:54,343 --> 00:03:55,802
in jujutsu combat.

83
00:03:57,553 --> 00:03:59,845
[Maki] Megumi, you'd
better not lose that!

84
00:04:00,761 --> 00:04:01,904
[Megumi] Don't worry, I won't.

85
00:04:01,928 --> 00:04:04,261
[Maki] It's probably worth
five billion if you sold it.

86
00:04:04,344 --> 00:04:06,554
[Megumi] Huh?

87
00:04:06,637 --> 00:04:09,054
[Maki] Special-grade
cursed tool: Playful Cloud!

88
00:04:09,345 --> 00:04:12,846
(Hanami flies)

89
00:04:14,679 --> 00:04:17,221
(rock music)

90
00:04:24,638 --> 00:04:27,597
[Hanami] Indeed,
that is a good weapon.

91
00:04:27,681 --> 00:04:28,431
-(footsteps approaching)
-(Megumi claps)

92
00:04:28,514 --> 00:04:30,389
[Megumi] Demon Dog.

93
00:04:31,556 --> 00:04:33,389
With the exception of
my expanded technique,

94
00:04:33,472 --> 00:04:34,472
Bottomless Well,

95
00:04:35,598 --> 00:04:39,390
if any of my ten shikigami
are completely destroyed,

96
00:04:39,473 --> 00:04:41,765
I can never manifest them again!

97
00:04:41,849 --> 00:04:43,432
(rock music)

98
00:04:44,641 --> 00:04:46,766
[Megumi] However,

99
00:04:46,850 --> 00:04:47,599
all of the power and techniques

100
00:04:47,683 --> 00:04:50,641
of each of the
destroyed shikigami,

101
00:04:52,433 --> 00:04:54,934
are passed on to the others!

102
00:04:56,350 --> 00:04:58,684
(rock music)

103
00:04:59,726 --> 00:05:00,726
[Megumi] Totality!

104
00:05:02,851 --> 00:05:05,351
(Demon Dog roars)

105
00:05:05,435 --> 00:05:07,268
(rock music)

106
00:05:07,351 --> 00:05:08,226
[Hanami] It learns fast.

107
00:05:08,310 --> 00:05:10,727
It's trying to take off
my wounded arm first.

108
00:05:13,060 --> 00:05:15,769
The sorcerer boy
is in the forest.

109
00:05:15,853 --> 00:05:17,020
(water splashing)

110
00:05:17,102 --> 00:05:18,020
(Maki grunts)

111
00:05:18,102 --> 00:05:18,477
(sword clangs)

112
00:05:18,561 --> 00:05:19,602
(Hanami grunts)

113
00:05:19,686 --> 00:05:21,602
[Hanami] The boy's sword!

114
00:05:21,686 --> 00:05:25,270
(Megumi grunts)

115
00:05:25,353 --> 00:05:26,645
Maki!

116
00:05:26,729 --> 00:05:28,021
(Maki grunts)

117
00:05:28,103 --> 00:05:29,770
(water splashing)

118
00:05:29,854 --> 00:05:31,979
(Maki and Megumi grunt)

119
00:05:32,062 --> 00:05:35,187
(Hanami gags)

120
00:05:35,271 --> 00:05:38,479
Don't ever let me use
that three-piece staff again!

121
00:05:38,563 --> 00:05:40,313
It's too hard!

122
00:05:40,396 --> 00:05:41,855
Ah, you get used to-(gasp)

123
00:05:41,938 --> 00:05:44,023
-Megumi!
-(Megumi gags)

124
00:05:44,105 --> 00:05:46,105
(curse laughs)

125
00:05:46,188 --> 00:05:47,064
(Maki gasps)

126
00:05:47,147 --> 00:05:48,188
(Maki grunts)

127
00:05:48,272 --> 00:05:49,023
[Megumi] Maki!

128
00:05:49,105 --> 00:05:52,024
Damn it! All
because I screwed up!

129
00:05:52,106 --> 00:05:54,398
(Maki grunts)

130
00:05:54,481 --> 00:05:56,857
[Hanami] My strike was
aimed for your heart.

131
00:05:56,940 --> 00:05:58,481
What a wonderful reaction.

132
00:06:00,398 --> 00:06:03,399
Jujutsu sorcerers are so
extraordinarily compassionate.

133
00:06:03,482 --> 00:06:07,232
As a result, an opening
is always created

134
00:06:07,316 --> 00:06:09,066
when their ally is injured.

135
00:06:09,149 --> 00:06:11,817
(water splashing)

136
00:06:11,900 --> 00:06:13,233
-(Megumi groans)
-(Maki gasps)

137
00:06:13,317 --> 00:06:14,692
[Maki] Was it destroyed?

138
00:06:14,775 --> 00:06:16,567
No, Megumi released
the technique!

139
00:06:18,942 --> 00:06:20,501
[Hanami] You shouldn't use
cursed techniques anymore.

140
00:06:20,525 --> 00:06:25,359
The bud embedded in you
now, loves cursed energy.

141
00:06:25,443 --> 00:06:27,359
So the more you use techniques,

142
00:06:27,443 --> 00:06:29,568
the deeper its roots will
extend into your body.

143
00:06:30,610 --> 00:06:33,235
What good's the warning?

144
00:06:33,319 --> 00:06:35,152
If you're just gonna
kill us anyway?

145
00:06:35,610 --> 00:06:39,694
[Hanami] Apparently, it
works faster when I explain it.

146
00:06:39,777 --> 00:06:41,611
(Maki grunts)

147
00:06:41,695 --> 00:06:42,695
[Hanami] You move well.

148
00:06:42,778 --> 00:06:44,903
(Maki grunts)

149
00:06:44,987 --> 00:06:46,236
(Hanami punches)

150
00:06:46,320 --> 00:06:49,070
(Maki chokes)

151
00:06:49,153 --> 00:06:51,946
[Hanami] But, you're missing
the edge you had earlier.

152
00:06:53,446 --> 00:06:55,738
(dark music)

153
00:07:00,196 --> 00:07:03,280
[Megumi] I have to wring
out that cursed energy!

154
00:07:03,363 --> 00:07:05,196
Even if it rips my stomach open!

155
00:07:06,780 --> 00:07:08,488
I'm not like everyone else.

156
00:07:08,572 --> 00:07:11,239
I choose who I protect!

157
00:07:12,489 --> 00:07:14,781
I shoulder the
least responsibility!

158
00:07:16,032 --> 00:07:17,197
Therefore,

159
00:07:17,698 --> 00:07:20,907
I am simply not allowed

160
00:07:20,991 --> 00:07:23,074
to fall before anyone else!

161
00:07:25,699 --> 00:07:26,615
(Megumi gasps)

162
00:07:26,699 --> 00:07:29,283
(Megumi yells)

163
00:07:29,366 --> 00:07:30,575
[Maki] Megumi, stop!

164
00:07:31,658 --> 00:07:32,992
[Megumi] Huh?

165
00:07:34,700 --> 00:07:36,616
We did it! Our job here is done!

166
00:07:37,575 --> 00:07:39,701
It's time to tag out.

167
00:07:41,076 --> 00:07:43,826
(water splashes)

168
00:07:48,702 --> 00:07:49,702
Huh?

169
00:07:49,785 --> 00:07:53,118
(fast music)

170
00:07:56,077 --> 00:07:58,453
Alright, friend. You good to go?

171
00:08:02,078 --> 00:08:03,119
Yeah!

172
00:08:03,745 --> 00:08:06,911
(opening theme music)

173
00:08:09,829 --> 00:08:13,038
(singing in Japanese)

174
00:09:28,170 --> 00:09:30,962
(music fades out)

175
00:09:35,629 --> 00:09:37,796
(Momo groans)

176
00:09:37,880 --> 00:09:39,713
(heavy breathing)

177
00:09:39,796 --> 00:09:40,796
So heavy!

178
00:09:42,504 --> 00:09:45,756
I can't believe these
two got beaten this badly!

179
00:09:45,839 --> 00:09:47,505
Come on, Todo.

180
00:09:47,589 --> 00:09:48,630
We need you.

181
00:09:49,839 --> 00:09:52,672
Your strength is the one
thing you've got going for you.

182
00:09:52,756 --> 00:09:55,631
(water running)

183
00:09:56,882 --> 00:09:59,840
Forget it, Itadori!

184
00:09:59,923 --> 00:10:01,683
You may think you can
handle that thing, but-

185
00:10:01,757 --> 00:10:05,132
(Megumi gags)

186
00:10:05,215 --> 00:10:05,758
Panda.

187
00:10:05,841 --> 00:10:06,841
I'm right here.

188
00:10:09,424 --> 00:10:11,966
Take these two and
get them out of the veil.

189
00:10:12,050 --> 00:10:14,592
According to the
report from Nishimiya,

190
00:10:14,675 --> 00:10:15,925
this is an anti-Gojo veil.

191
00:10:16,009 --> 00:10:19,842
So the rest of us can come
and go without any issues.

192
00:10:19,925 --> 00:10:22,968
-Wait! Not even you
can't- -[Yuji] Fushiguro.

193
00:10:23,052 --> 00:10:24,052
Huh?

194
00:10:26,885 --> 00:10:27,885
It's okay.

195
00:10:28,259 --> 00:10:29,426
It's okay.

196
00:10:30,052 --> 00:10:32,385
(Megumi gasps)

197
00:10:32,469 --> 00:10:34,510
Looks like you've realized it.

198
00:10:34,594 --> 00:10:36,510
Those who are growing wings

199
00:10:36,594 --> 00:10:39,510
are forever untouchable
by the rest of us.

200
00:10:39,594 --> 00:10:42,636
And that's exactly where
Itadori is standing now.

201
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:43,553
(Megumi hisses)

202
00:10:43,636 --> 00:10:45,720
You die again and
I'll kill you myself!

203
00:10:45,803 --> 00:10:46,928
Come on now, let's go.

204
00:10:49,511 --> 00:10:50,511
Pandash!

205
00:10:50,803 --> 00:10:53,929
Well alright then! I
guess I'd better not die.

206
00:10:55,596 --> 00:10:57,512
I'm not going to lift
a finger to help you,

207
00:10:57,596 --> 00:10:59,429
you know that, right, Itadori?

208
00:11:00,055 --> 00:11:03,014
Not until you
land a Black Flash.

209
00:11:04,056 --> 00:11:05,805
If you can't land a Black Flash,

210
00:11:05,889 --> 00:11:07,930
then I'll just watch you die.

211
00:11:08,014 --> 00:11:09,889
No matter what
happens to you. Got that?

212
00:11:10,973 --> 00:11:13,431
Yes!

213
00:11:13,514 --> 00:11:14,890
[Hanami] Ah, Sukuna's vessel.

214
00:11:14,973 --> 00:11:15,890
And

215
00:11:15,973 --> 00:11:18,556
who is that man?

216
00:11:18,639 --> 00:11:19,890
He has a certain presence,

217
00:11:19,973 --> 00:11:23,390
but the amount of
cursed energy he possesses

218
00:11:23,474 --> 00:11:24,932
is most definitely
less than mine.

219
00:11:26,932 --> 00:11:29,849
However, he has that
mysterious brazenness.

220
00:11:29,932 --> 00:11:31,076
He must have
quite the technique,

221
00:11:31,100 --> 00:11:34,141
since I can't move
freely before him.

222
00:11:35,100 --> 00:11:38,683
So, what is this "Black Flash,"

223
00:11:38,767 --> 00:11:40,309
and how will they attack?

224
00:11:43,476 --> 00:11:44,018
You can talk?

225
00:11:44,101 --> 00:11:45,934
That's interesting.

226
00:11:46,851 --> 00:11:50,727
In that case, there's
something I want to ask you.

227
00:11:51,685 --> 00:11:53,185
Are you connected with

228
00:11:54,352 --> 00:11:57,143
a humanoid cursed spirit
with a patchwork face?

229
00:11:59,061 --> 00:12:01,519
[Hanami] And if I say that I am?

230
00:12:02,811 --> 00:12:03,728
(Yuji roars)

231
00:12:03,811 --> 00:12:05,227
(water splashes)

232
00:12:05,311 --> 00:12:07,603
[Hanami] He didn't
carelessly close the distance!

233
00:12:07,686 --> 00:12:09,228
I commend him for that.

234
00:12:09,312 --> 00:12:10,812
(Yuji grunts)

235
00:12:10,896 --> 00:12:13,104
[Hanami] He's fast!

236
00:12:13,187 --> 00:12:16,104
And he has more explosive
power than that girl, earlier.

237
00:12:16,187 --> 00:12:17,937
However, its intensity is poor.

238
00:12:20,146 --> 00:12:21,980
[Yuji] I have a wide open shot!

239
00:12:22,064 --> 00:12:24,480
It's letting its guard
down because I held back!

240
00:12:24,563 --> 00:12:25,563
I can land it now!

241
00:12:26,688 --> 00:12:27,022
Black Flash!

242
00:12:27,105 --> 00:12:29,439
(rock music)

243
00:12:29,522 --> 00:12:30,522
(Todo gasps)

244
00:12:30,564 --> 00:12:32,647
(Yuji yells)

245
00:12:32,731 --> 00:12:33,106
[Yuji] Damn it!

246
00:12:33,189 --> 00:12:36,522
(water splashes)

247
00:12:36,606 --> 00:12:38,940
(Yuji gasps)

248
00:12:40,107 --> 00:12:41,148
[Todo] My friend.

249
00:12:42,940 --> 00:12:44,107
(Todo slaps)

250
00:12:44,190 --> 00:12:46,940
Anger is a trigger
for sorcerers,

251
00:12:47,024 --> 00:12:49,149
and it can work
for you both ways.

252
00:12:49,232 --> 00:12:51,941
A sorcerer can be
taken down in a fight

253
00:12:52,025 --> 00:12:54,816
simply because he
accidentally enraged his foe.

254
00:12:56,399 --> 00:12:58,650
And the opposite is also true.

255
00:12:58,734 --> 00:13:00,776
Sometimes they lose
because their own anger

256
00:13:00,859 --> 00:13:02,150
disrupts their cursed energy

257
00:13:02,233 --> 00:13:05,026
to the point they can't
exercise their abilities.

258
00:13:05,109 --> 00:13:06,126
Your friend has gotten hurt.

259
00:13:06,150 --> 00:13:08,318
And what's even worse than that,

260
00:13:08,401 --> 00:13:10,276
they've rained on your
honeymoon with me,

261
00:13:10,360 --> 00:13:10,985
your new best friend.

262
00:13:11,069 --> 00:13:13,360
So take it from me.

263
00:13:13,443 --> 00:13:16,819
I can absolutely understand
why you're boiling with rage.

264
00:13:17,652 --> 00:13:19,819
But all that rage is
too much for you!

265
00:13:19,903 --> 00:13:20,986
So, put it away for now.

266
00:13:21,070 --> 00:13:23,152
(water running)

267
00:13:23,235 --> 00:13:25,903
(Todo slaps)

268
00:13:25,986 --> 00:13:28,029
[Hanami] Are they
fighting each other?

269
00:13:30,403 --> 00:13:32,904
So how do you feel?
You clear-headed now?

270
00:13:33,987 --> 00:13:37,237
Yeah, no stray thoughts left!

271
00:13:38,446 --> 00:13:41,404
Thank you for that,
my new best friend!

272
00:13:42,237 --> 00:13:43,821
(upbeat music)

273
00:13:43,905 --> 00:13:45,822
[Todo] Black Flash.

274
00:13:45,906 --> 00:13:47,697
It's a distortion of space,

275
00:13:47,781 --> 00:13:49,822
born from the impact
of cursed energy

276
00:13:49,906 --> 00:13:52,489
delivered within a trillionth
of a second of a blow.

277
00:13:55,114 --> 00:13:56,257
It delivers two point five times

278
00:13:56,281 --> 00:13:59,239
the force of a normal strike.

279
00:13:59,323 --> 00:14:03,323
There are no sorcerers who
can consistently use Black Flash.

280
00:14:04,490 --> 00:14:05,532
However,

281
00:14:06,657 --> 00:14:09,157
between those who have
experienced Black Flash

282
00:14:09,240 --> 00:14:11,033
and those who have not,

283
00:14:11,116 --> 00:14:13,866
their distance from the
core of cursed energy

284
00:14:13,949 --> 00:14:16,575
is like the distance
of Heaven from Earth!

285
00:14:16,658 --> 00:14:19,283
(Yuji exhales)

286
00:14:22,283 --> 00:14:24,118
[Hanami] What
tremendous concentration!

287
00:14:24,201 --> 00:14:26,077
[Todo] The instant cursed
energy makes impact

288
00:14:26,159 --> 00:14:29,077
within that trillionth
of a second of a blow,

289
00:14:33,284 --> 00:14:35,619
space is distorted,

290
00:14:35,702 --> 00:14:37,119
and cursed energy flashes black!

291
00:14:39,160 --> 00:14:40,285
[Yuji] Black Flash!

292
00:14:41,494 --> 00:14:43,202
(upbeat music)

293
00:14:47,995 --> 00:14:50,495
(Todo chuckles)

294
00:14:51,536 --> 00:14:53,162
[Todo] He's done it.

295
00:14:54,162 --> 00:14:56,579
(music fades out)

296
00:14:59,704 --> 00:15:02,080
(dark music)

297
00:15:11,372 --> 00:15:12,498
He's done it.

298
00:15:17,414 --> 00:15:19,956
Black Flash? So I did that?

299
00:15:22,040 --> 00:15:23,165
What is this?

300
00:15:23,248 --> 00:15:26,290
This is my cursed energy
I'm sensing, isn't it?

301
00:15:26,374 --> 00:15:29,665
[Todo] Now you understand
the taste of cursed energy.

302
00:15:29,749 --> 00:15:30,290
Huh?

303
00:15:30,374 --> 00:15:33,625
(dark music)

304
00:15:34,125 --> 00:15:36,249
Up until now,

305
00:15:36,333 --> 00:15:37,042
you've just been
taking an ingredient

306
00:15:37,125 --> 00:15:39,208
that you've never tasted before,

307
00:15:39,291 --> 00:15:41,459
and throwing it into
a pot and boiling it,

308
00:15:41,542 --> 00:15:43,209
without understanding why.

309
00:15:44,793 --> 00:15:47,709
But now, after
experiencing Black Flash,

310
00:15:47,793 --> 00:15:49,185
you understand the
taste of your ingredient,

311
00:15:49,209 --> 00:15:51,752
your cursed energy.

312
00:15:51,835 --> 00:15:54,668
You stand on a completely
different level as a chef

313
00:15:54,752 --> 00:15:57,460
than you did just
three seconds ago.

314
00:15:57,543 --> 00:16:00,086
So congratulations, brother.

315
00:16:00,168 --> 00:16:04,211
Now you can become truly strong!

316
00:16:04,294 --> 00:16:06,336
[Hanami] I had been
told that Sukuna's vessel

317
00:16:06,419 --> 00:16:09,252
was immature as a sorcerer.

318
00:16:10,252 --> 00:16:12,545
But he and this mysterious man,

319
00:16:12,629 --> 00:16:15,796
something about them is
different from the other masses.

320
00:16:17,253 --> 00:16:18,754
It can heal?

321
00:16:18,837 --> 00:16:21,254
A cursed spirit is made
up of cursed energy.

322
00:16:22,254 --> 00:16:24,005
Therefore, unlike us,

323
00:16:24,089 --> 00:16:25,272
they don't need advanced
reversed cursed techniques

324
00:16:25,296 --> 00:16:27,880
to heal their bodies.

325
00:16:27,963 --> 00:16:29,171
An injury like that

326
00:16:29,254 --> 00:16:32,172
would mean very
little to a special-grade.

327
00:16:32,255 --> 00:16:33,506
But there's no doubt

328
00:16:33,589 --> 00:16:35,297
that it shaves away
their cursed energy,

329
00:16:35,381 --> 00:16:38,381
and if you crush their head,
it's game set and match.

330
00:16:39,255 --> 00:16:40,340
Now!

331
00:16:40,423 --> 00:16:42,673
What do you say
you and I get cooking?

332
00:16:44,840 --> 00:16:46,091
[Hanami] It would seem

333
00:16:46,882 --> 00:16:50,050
that perhaps

334
00:16:50,133 --> 00:16:52,257
I should take you two
somewhat seriously.

335
00:16:54,841 --> 00:16:56,758
-(Todo grunts)
-(Yuji gasps)

336
00:16:56,841 --> 00:16:58,341
(upbeat music)

337
00:16:58,424 --> 00:16:59,550
(Yuji gasps)

338
00:16:59,634 --> 00:17:02,384
(Todo grunts)

339
00:17:02,467 --> 00:17:04,051
(Yuji exhales)

340
00:17:04,134 --> 00:17:05,051
(Todo grunts)

341
00:17:05,134 --> 00:17:07,509
(Yuji grunts)

342
00:17:12,468 --> 00:17:14,760
Ungh! That's a
wide-ranging attack!

343
00:17:14,843 --> 00:17:16,052
Don't falter!

344
00:17:16,135 --> 00:17:17,895
Wide range attacks
have less speed and force.

345
00:17:20,053 --> 00:17:20,969
(Yuji gasps)

346
00:17:21,053 --> 00:17:21,427
(Todo grunts)

347
00:17:21,511 --> 00:17:24,969
(upbeat music)

348
00:17:25,053 --> 00:17:26,886
(Todo grunts)

349
00:17:26,969 --> 00:17:28,261
[Hanami] That hit hard!

350
00:17:28,345 --> 00:17:31,345
Their blows aren't as bad as
that flashy black one before.

351
00:17:31,428 --> 00:17:33,637
But each one possesses
enough force that,

352
00:17:33,720 --> 00:17:37,345
if they continue steadily,
they'll damage me!

353
00:17:37,429 --> 00:17:40,346
Todo! Let's coordinate
our timing better!

354
00:17:40,429 --> 00:17:42,097
Yeah!

355
00:17:42,179 --> 00:17:43,638
[Both] Huh?

356
00:17:43,721 --> 00:17:44,763
[Yuji] Our footing!

357
00:17:45,554 --> 00:17:47,098
[Todo] I messed up!

358
00:17:47,180 --> 00:17:49,472
I thought it was passing cursed
energy through real objects

359
00:17:49,555 --> 00:17:51,305
in order to manipulate
that much mass!

360
00:17:51,389 --> 00:17:53,806
But it's all the embodiment.

361
00:17:53,889 --> 00:17:55,972
The manifestation
of its cursed energy!

362
00:17:56,056 --> 00:17:57,556
That's a special-grade for you!

363
00:17:58,723 --> 00:18:00,556
[Hanami] Learn
how great the land is!

364
00:18:01,890 --> 00:18:03,491
[Todo] Attacking while
we fall? That's brutal!

365
00:18:03,515 --> 00:18:05,681
However!

366
00:18:05,765 --> 00:18:06,766
[Both] Brother!

367
00:18:08,100 --> 00:18:10,516
(both yell)

368
00:18:10,599 --> 00:18:12,307
[Hanami] They dodged that?

369
00:18:12,391 --> 00:18:14,849
But, what is this?

370
00:18:14,933 --> 00:18:16,517
This strange feeling?

371
00:18:17,475 --> 00:18:19,350
(water running)

372
00:18:24,017 --> 00:18:24,767
[Mahito] You know, Hanami,

373
00:18:24,850 --> 00:18:27,184
you should really
be more honest.

374
00:18:28,476 --> 00:18:30,935
[Hanami] I don't believe
I'm faking anything.

375
00:18:32,351 --> 00:18:34,559
[Mahito] I don't
mean to call you a liar.

376
00:18:35,769 --> 00:18:36,849
I know why you're fighting.

377
00:18:38,310 --> 00:18:40,310
But it's the process.

378
00:18:40,394 --> 00:18:42,352
You should enjoy the
battles, the present,

379
00:18:42,435 --> 00:18:44,936
much more than you do.

380
00:18:45,353 --> 00:18:48,520
[Hanami] Do you
enjoy them, Mahito?

381
00:18:48,603 --> 00:18:49,937
Well, yeah.

382
00:18:50,020 --> 00:18:51,062
Although,

383
00:18:51,353 --> 00:18:53,520
it was only recently
that the joy and pleasure

384
00:18:53,603 --> 00:18:58,105
I feel in battle became
my main motivation.

385
00:18:58,187 --> 00:18:59,729
Before I knew it,

386
00:18:59,813 --> 00:19:02,354
I began tricking,
deceiving, and murdering.

387
00:19:02,437 --> 00:19:04,605
And then suddenly
I felt fulfilled.

388
00:19:05,814 --> 00:19:08,271
I think just as humans
eat, sleep and screw,

389
00:19:08,355 --> 00:19:11,064
these things are
a curse's instincts.

390
00:19:11,605 --> 00:19:15,356
As cursed spirits, we may have
gained the power of reason.

391
00:19:15,439 --> 00:19:20,231
But that still doesn't justify
going against our instincts.

392
00:19:22,606 --> 00:19:25,899
For everyone, the soul is a
blend of instinct and reason.

393
00:19:25,982 --> 00:19:27,232
(chair creaks)

394
00:19:27,315 --> 00:19:28,565
So as a result,

395
00:19:28,649 --> 00:19:30,689
no one can say anything
about an individual's ratio.

396
00:19:32,816 --> 00:19:35,483
But your soul is a little
constrained, isn't it?

397
00:19:37,483 --> 00:19:38,650
You, Hanami,

398
00:19:39,691 --> 00:19:40,900
in actuality,

399
00:19:41,483 --> 00:19:44,818
you're much
stronger, aren't you?

400
00:19:46,068 --> 00:19:48,609
(Yuji groans)

401
00:19:48,692 --> 00:19:49,692
Todo!

402
00:19:50,567 --> 00:19:51,776
I'm just fine!

403
00:19:51,859 --> 00:19:53,443
(Todo grunts)

404
00:19:56,027 --> 00:19:57,944
(fast music)

405
00:19:58,027 --> 00:20:00,485
(Hanami lands)

406
00:20:05,486 --> 00:20:07,112
(Yuji grunts)

407
00:20:07,194 --> 00:20:08,379
[Yuji] It just expended
a ton of cursed energy!

408
00:20:08,403 --> 00:20:09,403
(Yuji grunts)

409
00:20:09,444 --> 00:20:11,361
[Todo] So now's our chance-

410
00:20:11,444 --> 00:20:12,654
(Todo grunts) To strike!

411
00:20:12,737 --> 00:20:14,737
You monster!

412
00:20:15,529 --> 00:20:17,612
(Todo lands)

413
00:20:17,695 --> 00:20:21,654
(bells chime)

414
00:20:21,738 --> 00:20:23,780
(both grunt)

415
00:20:23,863 --> 00:20:24,446
[Hanami] Mahito!

416
00:20:24,530 --> 00:20:25,530
Right now,

417
00:20:28,905 --> 00:20:29,905
I'm enjoying a fight!

418
00:20:30,446 --> 00:20:33,073
I'm enjoying a fight, Mahito!

419
00:20:35,531 --> 00:20:37,280
Are you good to go, brother?

420
00:20:37,364 --> 00:20:38,572
(Yuji grunts)

421
00:20:38,656 --> 00:20:40,531
-Yeah, you bet!
-That's excellent! Me too!

422
00:20:40,614 --> 00:20:41,824
(rock music)

423
00:20:41,907 --> 00:20:44,824
Then it's time to
unleash my technique!

424
00:20:45,698 --> 00:20:48,698
(closing theme music)

425
00:20:55,783 --> 00:20:58,991
(singing in Japanese)

426
00:22:09,457 --> 00:22:12,249
(music fades out)

427
00:22:15,499 --> 00:22:16,416
(upbeat music)

428
00:22:16,499 --> 00:22:18,126
[Juzo and Mahito] Juju Stroll!

429
00:22:18,208 --> 00:22:18,959
Coat rack!

430
00:22:19,042 --> 00:22:21,126
Gonna make a
great new coat rack,

431
00:22:21,208 --> 00:22:23,500
and it's gonna be so nice!

432
00:22:23,583 --> 00:22:24,500
Huh?

433
00:22:24,583 --> 00:22:25,959
-Hey!
-Huh?

434
00:22:26,042 --> 00:22:28,668
What would Gojo end up
looking like? If you do him?

435
00:22:31,209 --> 00:22:32,876
Definitely a standing rack.

436
00:22:34,376 --> 00:22:35,168
I'd use his hip girdle,

437
00:22:35,251 --> 00:22:37,169
with the sacral
bone and the coccyx,

438
00:22:37,252 --> 00:22:39,585
as the base for the stand.

439
00:22:39,669 --> 00:22:41,585
Then, I'd rework his femurs

440
00:22:41,669 --> 00:22:44,128
and use them to stabilize it.

441
00:22:44,210 --> 00:22:46,962
I'd use his spine's lumbar
and thoracic vertebrae

442
00:22:47,045 --> 00:22:49,920
all up to the third
cervical vertebrae.

443
00:22:50,003 --> 00:22:51,503
And to give it height, hey,

444
00:22:51,586 --> 00:22:53,753
ancient camphor
wood would be good!

445
00:22:53,837 --> 00:22:56,712
I'd use that to make
replicas of the vertebrae,

446
00:22:56,796 --> 00:22:57,629
and then alternate
them with the bones

447
00:22:57,712 --> 00:23:00,838
to accentuate the height.

448
00:23:00,921 --> 00:23:02,171
(upbeat music)

449
00:23:02,254 --> 00:23:03,855
[Juzo] Then I'd extend
the spinous process

450
00:23:03,879 --> 00:23:05,671
and complete the
transverse process,

451
00:23:05,754 --> 00:23:10,005
based on the overall
balance, to create the hangers.

452
00:23:10,089 --> 00:23:12,463
(upbeat music)

453
00:23:12,547 --> 00:23:15,630
I'd do that by grafting
on more ancient camphor.

454
00:23:15,714 --> 00:23:16,965
Depending on the coloring,

455
00:23:17,048 --> 00:23:19,881
it might be nice to cover
the skull with a tanned hide.

456
00:23:21,798 --> 00:23:24,132
Nice, right? So very nice!

457
00:23:25,297 --> 00:23:28,257
Yeah, this one could be
my best coat rack ever!

458
00:23:29,257 --> 00:23:30,174
What junk!

459
00:23:30,257 --> 00:23:31,757
(rock music)

460
00:23:36,883 --> 00:23:40,092
(music fades out)

